{"id":"12.0","doc":"T","title":"Overview (from the chip datasheet)","words":57,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The datasheet (section 4.1.3.7 General Purpose Timers) states that ESP32-S3 is embedded with four "},{"t":"num","v":"54-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" general-purpose timers, based on "},{"t":"num","v":"16-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" prescalers and "},{"t":"num","v":"54-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" auto-reload-capable up/down-timers (two timer groups with two timers each, see "},{"t":"xref","id":"12.1","c":[{"t":"text","v":"§12.1"}]},{"t":"text","v":")."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Its feature list is the same as the one in "},{"t":"xref","id":"12.1","c":[{"t":"text","v":"§12.1"}]},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}]}